# Trako behind Caddy, which gets and renews the HTTPS certificate by itself.
# Copy to Caddyfile, put in your domain (its DNS must point at this machine,
# ports 80 and 443 open), and run Trako with TRUST_PROXY=1 and HOST=127.0.0.1
# (see "HTTPS and access from the internet" in README.md).
trako.example.com {
	reverse_proxy localhost:44100
}
